      "en": "3. Use the following words and phrases in sentences: kufr and ilhad (disbelief and atheism), raij (current), tehzeebi islah (cultural reform), khalifa-e-Islam (Caliph of Islam), qaumiyat (nationhood), misali mamlikat (ideal state), intishar (disorder), mustahkam (firm), mareez-e-wujood (coming into existence).",
